vaevictis-hardening (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First version: the SSH, firewall, kernel and Firefox settings of
    VaeVictis OS 1.3 for systems installed from 1.1 or 1.2. Each file is
    replaced only if it is exactly the one those images installed; the SSH
    settings wait until every authorized key is ed25519.

